@startuml
' 通信图 — UC-20/21 AI决策 用例实现
' AI 蒙特卡洛决策消息传递 (Sprint 5 最终版)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 10

actor "AI Player" as AI

participant "CandidateGenerator" as CG
participant "OpponentHandSampler" as OHS
participant "MonteCarloSimulator" as MCS
participant "PhaseManager" as PM
participant "RuleEngine" as RE

== 候选生成 ==
AI -> CG: generate(hand, lastPlay, isFirstRound, isFirstTurn)
CG -> RE: recognizePattern(cards)
CG --> AI: candidates (TOP_K=4)

== 对手建模 ==
AI -> OHS: sampleWorlds(aiPlayer, gameState, cardTracker, 10)
OHS --> AI: 10 worlds

== 阶段判定 ==
AI -> PM: getCurrentPhase(aiPlayer, gameState)
PM --> AI: EARLY/MID/LATE

== 蒙特卡洛推演 ==
loop 每个候选
  AI -> MCS: evaluate(candidate, aiPlayer, state, worlds)
  MCS -> RE: 快速贪心推演
  MCS --> AI: expectedScore
  AI -> PM: adjustScore(baseScore, candidate, phase)
end

== 选择 ==
AI -> AI: 选最高分候选

@enduml
